{"id": "win11.flyouts.quick-settings-laptop.battery-click", "surface": "flyouts", "kind": "gesture", "label": "Battery read-out", "order": 40, "source": "hand:26300.9974", "capturedFrom": "26300.9974", "parent": "win11.flyouts.quick-settings-laptop", "behaviour": "The battery percentage in the footer opens the Power & battery page in Settings; its glyph shows the charge and whether the charger is in.", "disposition": "build"}
{"id": "win11.flyouts.quick-settings-laptop.sliders", "surface": "flyouts", "kind": "gesture", "label": "Sliders", "order": 41, "source": "hand:26300.9974", "capturedFrom": "26300.9974", "parent": "win11.flyouts.quick-settings-laptop", "behaviour": "Dragging, the arrow keys or the wheel set brightness and volume; the mute button toggles the output, and the volume glyph follows the level.", "disposition": "build"}
{"id": "win11.flyouts.quick-settings-laptop.chooser", "surface": "flyouts", "kind": "gesture", "label": "Output chooser", "order": 42, "source": "hand:26300.9974", "capturedFrom": "26300.9974", "parent": "win11.flyouts.quick-settings-laptop", "behaviour": "The arrow beside the volume slider opens the sound output page: picking a device makes it the default output at once; Volume mixer opens the per-app levels in Settings.", "disposition": "build"}
{"id": "win11.flyouts.quick-settings-laptop.card-session", "surface": "flyouts", "kind": "gesture", "label": "Media card session", "order": 43, "source": "hand:26300.9974", "capturedFrom": "26300.9974", "parent": "win11.flyouts.quick-settings-laptop", "behaviour": "The card appears while an app holds a media session and follows the most recent one; clicking it brings the app forward, and its buttons act on that session.", "disposition": "build"}
